{"questions":[{"id":"Q013","typeId":"零解與大係數","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S03:p1","S04:p1","S06:p1","S08:p2"],"prompt":"求使等式 (2/3)*x+1/2=(3/4)*x+1/2 成立的 x。","answer":"0","explanation":"合併同類項並移項，得 x＝0；代入原式左右相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(2/3)*x+1/2=(3/4)*x+1/2","root":"0","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"0"},{"id":"c2","text":"無解","misconception":"直接除以x而排除x為0的可能，漏掉唯一解。"},{"id":"c3","text":"任意實數","misconception":"將不同分數係數誤看成相同，沒有比較2/3與3/4。"},{"id":"c4","text":"1","misconception":"把分數係數誤當成未知數的解，沒有代入驗證。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q039","typeId":"代數簡記","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p1"],"prompt":"關於等式「7−7t＝7t−7」，下列哪個判斷與理由正確？","answer":"否","explanation":"取 t＝0，左邊為7，右邊為−7，因此不成立。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"不對所有t成立，而且兩邊對任何t都不相等。","misconception":"把非恆等誤當無解；t＝1時兩邊其實同為0。"},{"id":"c2","text":"對所有t成立，因為減法可以交換前後次序。","misconception":"把加法的交換律套到減法；7−7t與7t−7並非恆等。"},{"id":"c3","text":"不對所有t成立；t＝0時兩邊分別為7與−7。"},{"id":"c4","text":"對所有t成立，因為兩邊都有7和7t。","misconception":"忽略每一項的正負號，只看出現相同的數與字母。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q040","typeId":"代數簡記","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p1"],"prompt":"將 z 除以 −8，用含分數線的代數式表示。","answer":"-z/8","explanation":"除以−8即乘以−1/8。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"-8/z","misconception":"將被除數和除數顛倒，誤寫成−8除以z。"},{"id":"c2","text":"z/8","misconception":"除以負數時漏掉負號，應為−z/8。"},{"id":"c3","text":"-8z","misconception":"把除以−8誤當成乘以−8。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-z/8"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q041","typeId":"同類項化簡","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p1","S02:p4"],"prompt":"整理 9t−4t+6 的結果為何？","answer":"5t+6","explanation":"9t−4t＝5t，常數6保留。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"5t+6"},{"id":"c2","text":"5t","misconception":"只合併未知數項，漏寫原有的常數6。"},{"id":"c3","text":"11t","misconception":"把常數6當成同類項，與t的係數相加。"},{"id":"c4","text":"13t+6","misconception":"將9t減4t誤算成9t加4t。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q043","typeId":"乘除代數式","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p1"],"prompt":"化簡 18t×4÷(−6)。","answer":"-12t","explanation":"係數18×4÷(−6)＝−12。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"-3t","misconception":"只算18除以−6，漏乘中間的4。"},{"id":"c2","text":"12t","misconception":"係數乘除時遺漏除數−6的負號。"},{"id":"c3","text":"-12t"},{"id":"c4","text":"-27t","misconception":"誤把乘4再除−6看成除以4/−6。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q044","typeId":"代入求值","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p1","S05:p1"],"prompt":"若 r＝−4，求 3r−8 的值。","answer":"-20","explanation":"3×(−4)−8＝−20。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"-36","misconception":"把3r−8誤看成3(r−8)，多把8乘以3。"},{"id":"c2","text":"-9","misconception":"把3r誤讀為3+r，算成3−4−8。"},{"id":"c3","text":"4","misconception":"代入r時忘記r＝−4的負號，誤算3×4−8。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-20"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q046","typeId":"方程式辨識","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S03:p1","S06:p1"],"prompt":"下列哪個式子是一元一次方程式？","answer":"B","explanation":"B有等號、僅一種未知數，且未知數次數為1。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"6u+9","misconception":"只有代數式而沒有等號，不能稱為方程式。"},{"id":"c2","text":"4u−7＝13"},{"id":"c3","text":"u+v＝8","misconception":"含u與v兩個未知數，屬二元方程式。"},{"id":"c4","text":"u²＝16","misconception":"未知數最高次數為2，屬一元二次方程式。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q047","typeId":"方程式辨識","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S03:p1"],"prompt":"下列哪個選項只有代數式、沒有等號？","answer":"C","explanation":"C未表示兩個量相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"w/6＝2","misconception":"即使含分數，只要有等號仍是方程式。"},{"id":"c2","text":"3−w＝7","misconception":"未知數前有負號不影響其為含等號的方程式。"},{"id":"c3","text":"9w−11"},{"id":"c4","text":"8w＝24","misconception":"含有等號，已經是方程式，並非單獨代數式。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q048","typeId":"解的檢驗","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S03:p1","S04:p1","S09:p1","S17:p1"],"prompt":"將x＝−6代入4x+9＝−15，下列哪個判斷與計算正確？","answer":"是","explanation":"左邊4×(−6)+9＝−15。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"不成立；代入後左邊為33。","misconception":"代入時把x＝−6誤當+6，算成24+9。"},{"id":"c2","text":"不成立；代入後左邊為−33。","misconception":"將−24加9誤作−24減9。"},{"id":"c3","text":"不成立；代入後左邊為7。","misconception":"把4x誤讀成4+x，沒有做乘法。"},{"id":"c4","text":"成立；代入後左邊為−15，與右邊相等。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q049","typeId":"解的檢驗","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S09:p1"],"prompt":"檢驗x＝7/3是否為6(x−5/3)＝5的解，下列哪個判斷與計算正確？","answer":"否","explanation":"代入左邊為4，不是5。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"不是解；代入後左邊為4，與右邊5不相等。"},{"id":"c2","text":"不是解；代入後左邊為12。","misconception":"同分母相減時漏掉分母3，誤算6×(7−5)。"},{"id":"c3","text":"不是解；代入後左邊無定義。","misconception":"分數相減時連分母也相減，誤造出分母0。"},{"id":"c4","text":"不是解；代入後左邊為2/3。","misconception":"只完成括號內的減法，忘記外面還要乘6。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q050","typeId":"等量公理","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S02:p4","S03:p1","S06:p1","S07:p2"],"prompt":"若 5x−9＝26，兩邊同加14後，5x+5 等於多少？","answer":"40","explanation":"26+14＝40。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"31","misconception":"只注意−9變+5的表面差異，卻把右側只加5。"},{"id":"c2","text":"40"},{"id":"c3","text":"26","misconception":"只變動左側而保持右側不變，違反等量公理。"},{"id":"c4","text":"12","misconception":"將兩邊同加14錯做成右側減14。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q052","typeId":"等量公理","difficulty":"易","sourceRefs":["S02:p2","S03:p1"],"prompt":"若0.6x＝18，則6x等於多少？","answer":"180","explanation":"兩側同乘10。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"30","misconception":"只求出原方程式的x，沒有再計算題目要求的6x。"},{"id":"c2","text":"1800","misconception":"0.6變6只需乘10，誤將右側18乘100。"},{"id":"c3","text":"18","misconception":"只更改左側係數，右側沒有乘相同倍數。"},{"id":"c4","text":"180"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"}]}